bottomparticipants
actor User
boundary "Notification Page" as UI
boundary Router
control NotificationController
control NotificationService
entity ":NotificationModel" as NotificationModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Click "Mark as read"
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. PATCH /api/notification/mark-noti-as-read/{id}
activate Router

Router -> NotificationController: 3. markNotiAsRead(id)
activate NotificationController

NotificationController -> NotificationService: 4. markAsRead(id, payload)
activate NotificationService

NotificationService -> NotificationService: 5. Check user
activate NotificationService
space
deactivate NotificationService

opt Invalid user
  NotificationService --> NotificationController: 5.1. BadRequestException
  NotificationController --> Router: 5.2. HTTP error
  Router --> UI: 5.3. Show error
  UI --> User: 5.4. Show error
end

NotificationService -> NotificationModel: 6. findOne(_id, receiver_id)
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> MongoDB: 7. query notification
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> NotificationModel: 8. notification data
deactivate MongoDB
NotificationModel --> NotificationService: 9. return notification
deactivate NotificationModel

NotificationService -> NotificationService: 10. Check notification
activate NotificationService
space
deactivate NotificationService

opt Notification not found
  NotificationService --> NotificationController: 10.1. NotFoundException
  NotificationController --> Router: 10.2. HTTP error
  Router --> UI: 10.3. Show error
  UI --> User: 10.4. Show error
end

NotificationService -> NotificationModel: 11. set is_read=true, expireAt=+14 days
activate NotificationModel
NotificationModel -> MongoDB: 12. save notification
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> NotificationModel: 13. saved
deactivate MongoDB

NotificationModel --> NotificationService: 14. return updated notification
deactivate NotificationModel

NotificationService --> NotificationController: 15. success result
deactivate NotificationService

NotificationController --> Router: 16. HTTP response
deactivate NotificationController

Router --> UI: 17. Response data
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 18. Update notification state
deactivate UI
deactivate User